NAME
     getty - open a terminal and ask who is there

SYNOPSIS
     getty [-n] [-i] [-l PROGRAM] TTY

DESCRIPTION
     getty opens TTY, sets it up as a terminal, prints the issue and
     runs login on it. init starts one for each line in /etc/inittab and
     starts it again when it ends.

OPTIONS
     -n            do not ask for a name: run the program straight away
     -i            no issue
     -l PROGRAM    run this instead of login

SEE ALSO
     login(1), init(8), inittab(5)
